ional and priced separately.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"memorial-park-ruston","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Memorial Park","title":"Hang out at Memorial Park","subtitle":"Ruston city park","notes":"Bring a friend for a quiet outdoor break in the public park area; Memorial Park is first-come, first-served and not reservable.","short_summary":"A named, first-come Ruston park for a no-cost outdoor hang.","evidence_claim":"Ruston Parks and Recreation lists Memorial Park as first-come, first-served and says adjoining city-park areas remain open and available to the public at all times.","source_url":"https://www.rustonsportscomplex.com/index.php/reservations/","source_title":"City of Ruston Parks and Recreation Reservations","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Memorial Park is first-come, first-served and not reservable; follow city ordinances while using the public park.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
